{
  "title": { "zh": "装成一台去条纹仪", "en": "Assemble the interference remover" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "扫描台的局部处理器已经有用，却无法专门区分整幅图上的规则条纹。现在把二维分析、频率选择和二维重建接成机器，再与自己的空间处理器做公平对照。测试明确给出干扰位置，不要求猜频率或手算。 <wiki-ref to=\"interference-machine\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "Local processing helps the scanner but cannot selectively isolate global periodic stripes. Assemble 2D analysis, gain selection and reconstruction, then compare fairly with your spatial processor. Interference locations are supplied; there is no frequency guessing or hand calculation. <wiki-ref to=\"interference-machine\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[Y[u,v]=g[u,v]C[u,v]\\]\n\nC 是二维系数，g 是已知干扰对应的成对增益，Y 用于逆向重建。两个频率坐标让机器区分沿不同方向的变化，这是逐行处理缺少的信息。但若有用图像与干扰落在相同频率位置，去掉干扰的同时也会损失那部分信息。 <wiki-ref to=\"interference-machine\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[Y[u,v]=g[u,v]C[u,v]\\]\n\nC contains 2D coefficients, g the paired gains for known interference and Y the coefficients for reconstruction. Two frequency coordinates distinguish variation along different axes, information unavailable to a row-only filter. Useful structure sharing the selected frequencies is removed along with the interference. <wiki-ref to=\"interference-machine\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_finale",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "装配去干扰仪",
        "en": "Assemble remover"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "按已知干扰的成对增益，做二维频域处理与重建。另输出逐行频率处理、局部周期平滑两个对照，检查各自保留和遗漏的信息。 <wiki-ref to=\"frequency-filtering\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "Apply paired gains for known interference using 2D analysis and reconstruction. Also output row-frequency filtering and periodic local smoothing to compare retained and missed information. <wiki-ref to=\"frequency-filtering\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "带条纹观测", "en": "Striped observation" } },
        { "name": "gain", "label": { "zh": "已知干扰的增益规范", "en": "Known-interference gains" } },
        { "name": "kernel", "label": { "zh": "局部平滑对照核", "en": "Local-smoothing comparison kernel" } },
        { "name": "rowGain", "label": { "zh": "逐行频域对照增益", "en": "Row-filter comparison gains" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "去干扰图", "en": "Interference-removed image" } },
        { "name": "imaginary", "label": { "zh": "虚部残差", "en": "Imaginary residual" } },
        { "name": "local", "label": { "zh": "局部平滑对照", "en": "Local smoothing comparison" } },
        { "name": "rowOnly", "label": { "zh": "逐行频域对照", "en": "Row-frequency comparison" } }
      ],
